    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae Abiya garmoó waawutmo Yeroboamu i tiiq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu hareerós gari báy, «Ti adór heé hatlá' ilaaqas, tláw baraá gixsár Shilo didá' aarusmo Ahiya aníng iwa báy, ‹Kuúng a waawutmoó múk Israeli.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaátér mibaangw huweek nee maandaásaywo nee dahhángw niina oo danú huweek, inós gár na/ayrén gu slaw ngi qo oo'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harér Yeroboamu adoodá' gari tléhh, iri tleér ay Shilo, iri hardát doó Ahiya. Qoomaadae Ahiya xumsór kilá' ga aleeslayká, asma ilaawós na boo/ayé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aarusmo Ahiya guna gurbuú' guri báy, «Ga/aaweek harér Yeroboamu i baraá loohírí dirí', i amór do'ók keér, asma kuúng uwa yaahas daanduú garmaawose, asma i tiiq, daqaní aníng gár inós ka beer ngi oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harér Yeroboamu iwa hardát tina /ameenír hatlá' ilaaqás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Ahiya ngiwa axaás iwa darat afkú do'o iri oó', «Do' awangw, amaá Yeroboamu. Ahaá waáy gár tis heé hatlá' ilaaqamiin? Aníng kángw qoomaaká u koóm daanduuwoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tláw Yeroboamu ku beer, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, i kaahi, ‹Aníng kuúng una tsawaár baraá tla/ángw múk wa alé, uri qaás tawa waawutmoó muk'eé' oo Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuti'iima ngina hayóh dír xwaylár Daudi wa ale, nee ngay kuúng i haniís. Ala kuúng ar taa tléhh a dimbé nee tidá' sagadiyusmooeé' Daudi aa tleéhh, kudá' hara'ayar'eé' gaa oh, tidá' aníng ni slaa' ga eehar ar muunaáwós sleémeero, nee gana tleéhh tidá' hariim geeraeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng muruú tlákw una tléhh oo hee aa baloó tleehhiiká iimír aange. Kuúng aníng iga buhhtís, asma kuúng slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlá' iga tléhh, nee aníng iga áhh, iri alaá xu'ús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, ga/aaweek, án doó Yeroboamu u amotlakweérí huúw, hhawaataá do'ós i tsuú/ baraá múk Israeliro tam lawaalmo, laqaá tam lawaalmoowoká. Múk do'ós sleémeero u hhaamiís ar adoodá' muu tsuunkáy ngur da/aa/an iri da/aruut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé doó Yeroboamu oo qo gwaa'a baraá gixsárí ale, seeaawe gu /ák, nee heéqo baraá tsee/aá /awaákí gwaa'a tsir/o gu /ák. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiya harér Yeroboamu gari báy, «Gimáy sihhiít amór do'ók i watleek, qoomár bar darát baraá gixsa, na/aywók i gwaa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero i tsuunqus as inós nee kway fool, ala a kwí kilós oo ta fooli doó Yeroboamuwo, asma inós gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli nguwa sla'atís i deer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám laarír kilae, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ waawutmoó hatlá' gu qaas baraá yaamaá Israeliro, waawutmoowí doó Yeroboamu guri hhaamiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeít, iimír hamí AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli gu slaahh, inooín kiri diingiis adór gitsór ta dingimiisi nee ma'aá yaae. Inós múk Israeli guri hingees baraá yaamuuká hhoohhoo' taa baabi'ii'ín i haniís, nee kiri diyaa/ ayaá saáwí alé, gayuú yaaér Eufrate, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngwaa buhhtisiyé' as slaqsa'aá Ashera kiwa tleéhh, kuduú munguú /ameeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli gu sii' as tlakweemadá' Yeroboamu aa tleéhh, nee múk Israeli gway baraá tlakweemií dahaás.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harér Yeroboamu iri tleér, iri wátl amór do'ós baraá yaamaá Tirsa. Qoomár dír afkú do'o iwa darat, na/aywós iri tsatiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli sleémeero guri foól, kuri satsuunqumiís adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó' ar loohír aarusmo Ahiya sagadiyusmoowós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa waawutmo Yeroboamu, adoodá' tara slaáqw nee ira waawuti'ín sleémeero ka gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'i oo waawutuú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu waawuti'iima ngaa /aáy a kureeri mibeeri tsár nee tsár, aluuwo iri gwaá', nee Nadabu garmaawós iri waawuti'ín kitangós wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu garmoó Solomon waawuti'iimár yaamaá Yuda ngiwa sláy kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsiyáhh nee wak. Inós kureeri ngaa /aáy a mibaá nee faanqw, baraá waawuti'iimaro, baraá Yerusalemu, gixsadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tsawaár baraá gixsadaá hatlae awa tlahh'aá múk Israeli as kuwa baraadá wa sluufmiisi. Aayoorós a Na'ama ar xoorór Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yuda tlakweema gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. Inós nguri dá/tár ayé' as tlakweemaaín kudá' yaariir ta awa baabi'ii'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sleeme kiteeraá ilahhooa kawa hanmiis kina tleéhh gawaá gongoama', nee uheemiwo, nee slaqsa'aá munguaá ta bay Ashera ngina tleehhiyé' gawaá gongoama' nee baraá gam'ér umuúqo xa'anoó loo/o naa/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár ló'wa tlaakw a tí, hhawaate nina fuquusiyé' nee hhawaataá hatlá' baraá Doó Munguhe. Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Mungú i waki ngina tleehhiyé', adoodá' xoordaá hatlá' ta tlehhahhiti, kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa guús baraá yaamuudá' wa ale, dír geeraá múk Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
