          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú kooán oo waawuti'iimár Rehoboamu Shishaki, waawutmoó yaamaá Misri, ina haraatláy baraá gixsár Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xooslár doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sleémeero gari ar tlay, nee ar doó waawutmowo, umuú gaa gana ar tláy, nee sleeme gaambudá' Solomon aa tleéhh ar sahaábu gina ar sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitángw gaambukae, waawutmo Rehoboamu gaambudaá muqslár sirdaa/aten gina tleéhh, nee giri haniís kiwa xun nee xuumuusér afkú doó waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú daqto waawutmo bira baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ káy, xuumuuse gaambuudaá gin húp baraá doó Mungú, nee aluuwo kiri ki/is baraá do'odá' kiwa xun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
